rule: ELIM-G-5, CORE-INV-9
countdown returns IO (); raised, it takes the world and returns IORes.
CHECK: Main.countdown{_:Int.PrimIO.MkIO#0@(_:%World)} (%{{[0-9]+}} : w Int) (%{{[0-9]+}} : 1 %World) : PrimIO.IORes[Builtin.Unit] =
CHECK-NEXT: case %{{[0-9]+}} of
CHECK: Main.main{.PrimIO.MkIO#0@(_:%World)} (%{{[0-9]+}} : 1 %World)
CHECK-NEXT: Main.countdown{_:Int.PrimIO.MkIO#0@(_:%World)}(3:Int, %{{[0-9]+}})
